    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Caricature 1: Prospect Intake\n\nBefore activating: run supabase/migration.sql and fill the campaign_config row.\n\nPOST prospects to this workflow's webhook (path caricature-intake):\n\n`{\"prospects\":[{\"email\":\"\",\"first_name\":\"\",\"last_name\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"company_name\":\"\",\"carrier\":\"fedex\",\"tracking_number\":\"\"}]}`\n\nReturns each prospect's tracked URL and a print-ready QR PNG.\n\nCredentials: Supabase API, HubSpot App Token, Header Auth `X-Intake-Secret` on the webhook, Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <Ship24 key>`, Slack API.\n\nFull guide: caricature-campaign/docs/setup.md in github.com/sashank-and-sales-gtme/gtm-engineering-portfolio",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
